# herdr-floax configuration — nothing reads this file as of 0.4.0.
#
# The floating pane is a real zoomed herdr terminal, not an app-drawn box, so
# the 0.3.x nested-TUI keys (width_pct, height_pct, backdrop, scrollback_lines,
# key_hint) no longer have any effect. Copying this file to the plugin config
# dir does nothing.
#
# Behaviour is controlled entirely by environment variables — see the
# "Configuration" section of README.md, which owns that list. The keybind comes
# from scripts/install-keybinding.sh (its first argument or $HERDR_FLOAX_KEY).
#
# This file is kept only so 0.3.x configs have somewhere to look; it is a
# candidate for deletion along with the legacy src/ tree.
